    <briefdescription>
<para>Named scalar column distributed over a shared <ref refid="classoctotigerII_1_1storage_1_1PartitionSet" kindref="compound">PartitionSet</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Capacity is independent per partition and bank count is configurable. A replacement allocation receives a fresh field ID. Old fields survive until <ref refid="classoctotigerII_1_1storage_1_1Field_1ada880c3f2d71f6cada6108bfb2a68d10" kindref="member">retire()</ref> or destruction of the last partition handle; this is not an in-place resize API. Application stage publication remains a <ref refid="classoctotigerII_1_1Runtime" kindref="compound">Runtime</ref> responsibility. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
